    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veredilia: The Sacred Forest is a 2D bloody combat platforming game that takes inspiration from classic platformers on old consoles such as the Mega Drive, along with old-school beat-em-ups and fighting games combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the large forest of Veredilia across various locales with a wide range of characters, technical move-sets, and flashy combos. Take control of one of three heroes as you\u00a0kick, punch and slash your way to victory, while also solving puzzles, and uncovering secrets along the way in your quest save your beloved Forest from the impending forces of doom, before it's too late. Do you have what it takes? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three playable characters with unique attacks, special moves and campaigns</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rein the Caribou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toronto the Caribou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vancouver the Kitsune</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many action-packed stages with many environments to explore and enemies to fight against.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-on-one fights against many new faces and big bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of blood effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple locales throughout the forest, featuring maps, hubs, shops and characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted story and cutscenes in the style of in-game sprites and old-school hand-drawn Flash styled animations</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veredilia: The Sacred Forest is a 2D bloody combat platforming game that takes inspiration from classic platformers on old consoles such as the Mega Drive, along with old-school beat-em-ups and fighting games combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the large forest of Veredilia across various locales with a wide range of characters, technical move-sets, and flashy combos. Take control of one of three heroes as you\u00a0kick, punch and slash your way to victory, while also solving puzzles, and uncovering secrets along the way in your quest save your beloved Forest from the impending forces of doom, before it's too late. Do you have what it takes? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three playable characters with unique attacks, special moves and campaigns</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rein the Caribou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toronto the Caribou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vancouver the Kitsune</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many action-packed stages with many environments to explore and enemies to fight against.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-on-one fights against many new faces and big bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of blood effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple locales throughout the forest, featuring maps, hubs, shops and characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted story and cutscenes in the style of in-game sprites and old-school hand-drawn Flash styled animations</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover the large forest of Veredilia with three different characters as you fight your way like a pro in your quest to save The Sacred Forest from impending doom in this 2D bloody combat action platformer.",
